8115\", \"A34\": \"33\", \"B34\": \"60.70\", \"C34\": \"-3.1860\", \"A35\": \"34\", \"B35\": \"90.90\", \"C35\": \"-0.6824\", \"A36\": \"35\", \"B36\": \"86.26\", \"C36\": \"-1.0670\", \"A37\": \"36\", \"B37\": \"113.14\", \"C37\": \"1.1614\", \"A38\": \"37\", \"B38\": \"109.96\", \"C38\": \"0.8978\", \"A39\": \"38\", \"B39\": \"81.71\", \"C39\": \"-1.4442\", \"A40\": \"39\", \"B40\": \"112.71\", \"C40\": \"1.1257\", \"A41\": \"40\", \"B41\": \"84.97\", \"C41\": \"-1.1740\", \"A42\": \"41\", \"B42\": \"98.71\", \"C42\": \"-0.0349\", \"A43\": \"42\", \"B43\": \"95.59\", \"C43\": \"-0.2936\", \"A44\": \"43\", \"B44\": \"101.72\", \"C44\": \"0.2146\", \"A45\": \"44\", \"B45\": \"112.28\", \"C45\": \"1.0901\", \"A46\": \"45\", \"B46\": \"109.58\", \"C46\": \"0.8663\", \"A47\": \"46\", \"B47\": \"105.25\", \"C47\": \"0.5073\", \"A48\": \"47\", \"B48\": \"109.75\", \"C48\": \"0.8803\", \"A49\": \"48\", \"B49\": \"107.18\", \"C49\": \"0.6673\", \"A50\": \"49\", \"B50\": \"90.60\", \"C50\": \"-0.7072\", \"A51\": \"50\", \"B51\": \"89.24\", \"C51\": \"-0.8200\", \"A52\": \"Mean\", \"B52\": \"99.13\", \"A53\": \"Std Dev\", \"B53\": \"12.06\"}}], \"active\": \"Statistics\"}"
